          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מוֹשֵׁל עוֹלָם בִּגְבוּרָתוֹ. יִרְעֲשׁוּ הָרִים מִגַּאֲוָתוֹ. וּכְאֵילִים יִרְקְדוּ מִגַּעֲרָתוֹ:",
            "page_start": true
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/14"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ נוֹרָא לְמַלְכֵי אָרֶץ. חוֹל תָּחוּל הָאָרֶץ. מִיּוֹשֵׁב הַכְּרוּבִים תָּנוּט הָאָרֶץ:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/15"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ שְׂאֵתוֹ מִי יַעֲצָר־כֹּחַ. וְהוּא נוֹשֵׂא כֹל בַּכֹּחַ. נוֹתֵן לַיָּעֵף כֹּחַ:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/16"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ עָמְדוֹ לָדִין. בְּיוֹם הַדִּין. שְׁפּוֹט גֵּאִים בַּדִּין:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/17"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ פִּלֵּשׂ סוֹד הַמַּעֲמִיקִים. לַסְתִּיר עֵצָה בְּמַעֲמַקִּים. יֶחֱשֹׂף וִיגַלֶּה עֲמוּקִים:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/18"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ צַוֵּה מִכָּל־רוּחַ. עָרִיצֵי גַּסֵּי הָרוּחַ. לְאַפְּפָם בְּשֶׁטֶף רוּחַ:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/19"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ קְהֵל מַלְכֵי אֲדָמָה. בְּסַעֲרוֹ מַשָּׂא דוּמָה. יִפְקֹד עַל צְבָא רוּמָה:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/20"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ רָם וְגָבֹהַּ בַּמִּשְׁפָּט. וְעֹז מֶלֶךְ אָהֵב מִשְׁפָּט. מְכוֹן כִּסְאוֹ צֶדֶק וּמִשְׁפָּט:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/21"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ שׁוֹפֵט צֶדֶק. לְפָנָיו יְהַלֵּךְ צֶדֶק. לְהָלִיץ בְּעַד רוֹדְפֵי צֶדֶק:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/22"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ תַּקִּיף בְּמֶמְשָׁלָה. וְכִסְאוֹ תָּלָה לְמַעְלָה. וּמַלְכוּתוֹ בַּכֹּל מָשָׁלָה:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/23"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ תִחֵת חֶלֶד מֵהַבִּיטוֹ. מַרְעִיד יְסוֹד בְּהַבִּיטוֹ. בַּכֹּל מְשׁוֹטֵט מַבָּטוֹ:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/24"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 3,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ תָּר בְּכָל־פֹּעַל. בַּכֹּל מַה יִפְעַל. בְּמַטָּה וּבְמָֽעַל:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
        "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:melekh_azur_gevurah/25"
      },
      {
        "paragraph": 4,
        "fragments": [
          {
            "scan": "s100",
            "printed_page": "36",
            "text": "מֶלֶךְ אֱלֹהֵי עוֹלָם. הִמְלִיכוּהוּ עַם עוֹלָם. יְיָ יִמְלֹךְ לְעוֹלָם. קָדוֹשׁ:",
            "page_start": false
          }
        ],
        "reference_unit": "stanza",
